  "body": "Expose `OpType::RotaryFlow` in the egui property panel, ribbon, and MCP feature-picking validation.\n\nWhat to build:\n- Draw an original `op-rotary-flow` SVG/PNG icon in `assets/ui/` (MIT/original, no vendor assets) and wire it in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/icons.rs` and `op_icons.rs`.\n- Add `OpParams::RotaryFlow` fields in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/rotary_page.rs` using `rotary_editor` and `rotary_axis_editor`, with Geometry hints explaining edge-chain guide picks.\n- Add `OpParams::RotaryFlow` to `crates/app/src/mcp/pick.rs::kind_door` so only `FeatureSel::Chain` picks are accepted (`add_operation`, `edit_operation`, and `list_operation_types` read `KindInfo::ALL` and `ParamsDto` automatically).\n\nDepends on #2826 (`OpType::RotaryFlow` app wiring).\n\nDone means: `Rotary Flow` renders in the Multi-axis ribbon and property panel with passing `crates/ui` structural tests, and MCP tools list, create, edit, set chain picks for, and refuse non-chain picks on `Rotary Flow` operations.\n\nPart of #2804\n",
